WEBVTT

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:08.020
It'll take a while to fix the feeds to 
the Volcano and Ancient Ruins Areas.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:12.590
So please enjoy the Jungle Area 
where our feed is still working!

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.060
Seriously?

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.150
Act more professional!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Michy is such a huge star that 
they're only broadcasting him!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.030
Yoko...

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:26.510
Yeah, Michy!

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.740
If I can't see my darling, 
there's no point watching TV.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:35.010
I'll use my crystal ball to watch instead-

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:36.950
No!

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:42.010
I'll go see my darling in person instead!

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:48.890
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:54.090
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:57.140
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:01.380
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:04.130
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.790
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:09.600
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:20.710
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:26.180
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:31.790
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:35.920
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:39.860
Repeating Up/Down

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:42.200
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:49.470
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:52.910
Because I don't want to give up

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:57.910
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:04.990
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:15.500
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:18.200
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.900
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:23.700
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.450
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:35.000
Xiangke and Xiangsheng

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:48.930
Please enjoy this duel that's full of food.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:51.050
Eat up until there's nothing left.

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:53.570
Keep it up, Michy!

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:56.040
They'll fall over from overeating!

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.280
Outta the way!

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:02.080
I can't see if you stand in front of me!

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:06.460
Instead of just watching, 
why don't you duel too?

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:13.640
Following the rules, the man Gongenzaka 
wagers one card and challenges you to a duel!

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:15.060
I refuse.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:16.040
What?

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:21.510
If you want to duel me, bring 
at least five Pendulum Cards!

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:25.490
How rude!

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:29.140
Gongenzaka officially challenged 
him to a duel, but...

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.750
He's not going to duel fair and square.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.960
He's so unfair that it gives me shivers!

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:38.930
What's going on with Yuya?  And Yuzu?

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:50.470
You look alike.  Twins?

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:53.580
Are you Ruri?

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:55.230
Bring it on!

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:59.520
I know that you're a Xyz refugee!

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.640
Xyz refugee?

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:04.400
No, that's not true.

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:06.250
Don't play dumb!

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:09.320
If you won't come after me, 
then I'll come after you!

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:12.280
Wait a second!

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:17.290
We're in the middle of the Junior 
Youth Championship battle royal.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:18.410
You're-

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:20.330
It's fine, Yuzu.

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:24.980
She has the wrong idea,

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:28.980
but accepting this challenge is what 
entertainment dueling is about!

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.720
Right?

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:36.400
Were you even listening to me?

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:40.690
Let's begin!  Yuzu, stay back.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:45.660
But make sure to watch because it's 
more fun when there's an audience.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:46.900
Duel!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.560
My turn!

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:53.270
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:55.240
Polymerization?

00:04:55.460 --> 00:05:01.040
I fuse Lunalight Blue Cat and 
Lunalight Purple Butterfly!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:07.200
The cat loitering in the blue darkness!  
The butterfly with purple poison!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:11.420
Swirl in the moon's gravity 
and be reborn with new power!

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.530
Fusion Summon!

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:20.000
Appear, the beautiful beast 
that dances in the moonlight!

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.300
Lunalight Cat Dancer!

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.880
I knew it.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.850
A high level Fusion Summon 
detected in the Volcano Area!

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:40.120
It's much stronger than the one 
we detected in the Iceberg Area!

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.290
Ruri is Kurosaki's younger sister.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:48.510
If she's from Xyz Dimension, 
she would never use Fusion.

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:51.950
So who is she?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:56.480
I set one card and end my turn!

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:59.260
Bring it on!

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:21.520
That's against the rules!

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:23.350
No, it's not.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.760
It's only natural that the loser disappears.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.000
Stop it.

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:28.460
Stop it.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:40.160
Stop it!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.120
Let's get back to our mission.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:50.850
Wait.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.770
I won't forgive you.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.830
I won't lose this time.

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:05.870
Duel!

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:08.360
I'll go first.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:11.570
I summon Edge Imp Tomahawk from my hand!

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:17.610
I activate Edge Imp Tomahawk's effect!

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:20.960
By sending one Edge Imp monster 
in my hand to the graveyard,

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:24.690
you take 800 points of damage!

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:35.300
I set one card and end my turn!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.330
My turn!

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:42.300
I summon Raidraptor - Vanishing Lanius!

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:49.950
When Raidraptor - Vanishing 
Lanius is on my field,

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:52.520
I can Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:55.720
Raidraptor - Fuzzy Lanius!

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:03.460
With Vanishing Lanius and Fuzzy 
Lanius, I build the Overlay Network!

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:08.030
The underworld's bird of prey,

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:13.470
expose the truth with your dark insight 
and snatch glory with your sharp claws!

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.500
Xyz Summon!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:16.670
Fly in!

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:21.680
Rank 4 Raidraptor - Force Strix!

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:28.620
Another Xyz Monster with low attack points.

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:33.150
Once per turn, by using one Overlay Unit,

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:39.360
I can add one Level 4 Winged Beast-Type 
Dark Attribute monster to my hand.

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:42.970
I add Vanishing Lanius to my hand.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.440
He got a card he needs from his deck.

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:50.140
I activate Fuzzy Lanius's 
effect from the graveyard.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.610
When this card is sent to the graveyard,

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:57.040
I add one Fuzzy Lanius 
from my deck to my hand.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:01.980
Due to the effect of the first 
Vanishing Lanius that I summoned,

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:06.530
I Special Summon another 
Vanishing Lanius from my hand!

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:14.400
When Vanishing Lanius is on the field, I can 
Special Summon Fuzzy Lanius from my hand.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:22.110
Force Strix gains 500 attack points

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:25.970
for every Winged Beast-Type monster 
on my field, other than itself.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:30.600
You powered it up, but it's still weak.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:33.620
Are you underestimating me?

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:37.790
I always duel seriously.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:42.060
Even against an unworthy opponent.

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:45.280
Hurry up and bring it on!

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:50.720
It's time for the show 
you've been waiting for!

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.680
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:58.170
I summon Performage Flame Eater from my hand!

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:06.110
When there are two monsters on the field,

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:09.840
I can Special Summon Performage 
Hat Tricker from my hand-

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:18.540
Two monsters with the same Level.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:20.630
He's planning to Xyz Summon.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:26.530
Aww...  If I Xyz Summon, her 
misunderstanding will get worse.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:32.000
Excuse me.  It's bath time!

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.380
One two three!

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:41.320
I activate the Continuous 
Spell Bubble Barrier.

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:46.830
Once per turn, each Performage 
with 1500-or-fewer attack points

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:49.460
can negate your monster's attack.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.990
I end my turn.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:53.380
Why?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.230
Why won't you Xyz Summon?

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:59.420
Because I'm not a Xyz refugee.

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:01.300
You're still playing dumb?

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:03.270
My turn!

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:07.610
I summon Lunalight Blue Cat from my hand!

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:15.100
I activate Lunalight Cat Dancer's effect!

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.150
I tribute Blue Cat!

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:21.720
It can attack each monster 
on your field twice!

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:23.710
So that's your plan.

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:24.910
Let's battle!

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:28.700
Cat Dancer attacks Flame Eater!

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:33.630
Due to Bubble Barrier's effect, your 
attack is negated once per turn.

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:37.240
Attack Flame Eater again!

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:49.250
Next, attack Hat Tricker!

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:55.990
Due to Bubble Barrier's effect, 
the attack is negated!

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:59.290
Attack Hat Tricker again!

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:09.000
Full Moon Cresta!

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.730
I end my turn.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:26.850
You show no mercy.

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:30.260
What's with her incredible power?

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:35.310
Is she from Fusion Dimension?

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:39.970
I won't forgive you.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:44.410
I won't forgive Fusion Dimension or Academia!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:45.870
Who are you?

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:52.080
Why did you come here?

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:55.050
You don't need to know.

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:58.460
I won't let you do whatever you like!

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:01.180
Duel me!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.530
You don't know your place.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:08.300
So we'll teach you.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:11.530
Duel!

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.260
My turn!

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:17.300
I summon Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.080
I end my turn.

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:24.960
Let's finish this fast.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:26.660
Yeah, quickly!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:27.750
My turn!

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:33.050
I summon Ancient Gear Hunting 
Hound and attack you directly!

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.460
That's an Action Card.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:45.920
But it's worthless!

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.800
When Ancient Gear Hunting Hound attacks,

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:53.910
you can't activate a spell or 
trap card until the attack ends!

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:01.550
I end my turn.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.280
My turn!

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:07.170
I also summon Ancient Gear Hunting Hound.

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:09.710
It attacks you directly!

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:16.960
I end my turn.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:21.400
You're already at the edge 
of a cliff, you fool.

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:25.140
You'll end up the same as them.

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:01.760
My turn!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:09.460
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 3 
Xiangke Magician and Scale 8 Xiangsheng Magician!

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:24.430
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 4 and 7 simultaneously!

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:27.400
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.370
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.610
Pendulum Summon!  Come out!

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:39.080
Level 4 Performapal Whip Snake!

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:43.550
And Level 4 Performapal Skeeter Skimmer!

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.520
So this is Pendulum Summon.

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:52.760
I overlay Level 4 Whip 
Snake and Skeeter Skimmer!

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:57.200
From the black darkness,

00:15:57.200 --> 00:16:02.300
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:04.240
Xyz Summon!

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:10.610
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:16.450
Xyz after Pendulum?

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:17.920
Let's battle!

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:23.720
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon attacks 
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:27.930
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:38.620
I end my turn.

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:42.780
Who is this guy?

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:52.800
He has three copies of the same Xyz Monster.

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:54.950
How long will he keep going?

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:58.240
You're getting annoyed 
because you're impatient.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:01.290
Why don't you go pick up an Action Card?

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:05.060
No, I don't need it.

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:12.970
As long as there's an Xyz 
Monster on the field,

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:16.500
I can Special Summon Raidraptor 
- Singing Lanius from my hand.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:25.720
Due to Force Strix's effect, 
all three gain attack points!

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:30.540
My preparations are complete.

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:31.870
Let's battle!

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:37.930
This is such a tedious duel.

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:39.800
Hurry up and play!

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.660
I have to find the others!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.840
She's really scary.

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:49.540
I guess I'll get a little bit serious.

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:53.250
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:58.940
This is...

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.080
I lost.

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:04.820
I set one monster in defense position.

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:08.190
I set one card and end my turn.

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:15.540
In desperation, you set a monster and a card.

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:19.500
Are you taking me lightly?

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:21.470
No, that wasn't my intention-

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:23.280
There's no use arguing!

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:24.180
My turn!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:27.580
I summon Lunalight White Rabbit!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:35.600
Once per turn, it returns a spell or 
trap card on the field back to the hand.

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:37.370
I choose Bubble Barrier!

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:43.560
I activate Lunalight Cat Dancer's effect!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:47.070
By tributing White Rabbit, 
it can attack twice!

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:51.110
Let's battle!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:54.040
Cat Dancer attacks the set monster!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:05.480
Due to Cat Dancer's effect, the 
first attack can't destroy it.

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:09.150
I flip over my trap card Lunalight Dance!

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:12.250
When a Lunalight monster attacks,

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:16.250
all your monsters switch battle 
positions during that Battle Phase!

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.710
What?

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:24.050
And its attack and defense points 
are halved until the end of battle!

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:26.910
Let's battle!

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:31.080
Lunalight Cat Dancer attacks Trick Clown!

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:39.180
It's time for a miraculous illusion!

00:19:58.030 --> 00:19:59.800
You were pathetic.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:18.260
Another squad appeared in the Volcano Area!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:20.460
Send the Youth Team there!

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:44.950
You're not moving any further.

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:50.160
No one is here.

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:53.540
The city is sealed off for the battle royal.

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:58.660
Where is my darling dueling?

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:03.140
What's with him?

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:04.570
Let's finish him quick!

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:06.300
My turn!

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:10.280
I summon Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:15.310
When there's a monster on your field,

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:18.750
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound deals you 
600 points of damage once per turn!

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.380
Hound Flame!

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:32.370
My turn's over.

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:33.860
My turn!

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:36.020
I also use Hound Flame!

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.710
My turn's over!

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:55.820
Where's my darling?

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:00.660
Yuya.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.020
Darling!

00:22:28.300 --> 00:22:32.940
As long as there's a smile

00:22:35.180 --> 00:22:39.710
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:42.150 --> 00:22:45.020
I always believe

00:22:45.190 --> 00:22:48.540
In my tomorrow

00:22:48.890 --> 00:22:54.170
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:22:57.430 --> 00:23:02.800
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:09.680
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:09.840 --> 00:23:16.350
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:20.420
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:45.370 --> 00:23:47.570
My darling will be defeated!

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:51.420
Wait!  Is that really Yuya?

00:23:51.420 --> 00:23:58.820
